1
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:18,000
Chasing Coral is a documentary film directed by Jeff Orlowski.

2
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:30,000
Coral reefs are the nursery for all life in the oceans, a
remarkable ecosystem that sustains us.

3
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:42,000
Yet with carbon emissions warming the seas, a phenomenon called “coral bleaching”—a sign of mass coral death—has been accelerating
around the world, and the public has no idea of the scale or implication of the catastrophe silently raging underwater.

